1
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,160
How was your weekend, Teng Fei?

2
00:01:12,368 --> 00:01:13,744
It was terrible!

3
00:01:14,128 --> 00:01:16,464
Why? What happened?

4
00:01:16,944 --> 00:01:21,280
Well, first, I was on my way to meet my friends

5
00:01:21,552 --> 00:01:24,944
when some tourists asked me the way to the history museum.

6
00:01:25,408 --> 00:01:26,672
I didn’t mean to,

7
00:01:26,944 --> 00:01:29,488
but I gave them the wrong directions.

8
00:01:30,096 --> 00:01:32,624
I only realized it after they left!

9
00:01:33,232 --> 00:01:35,888
Oh no! But don’t worry.

10
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:38,528
They probably asked someone else too.

11
00:01:38,912 --> 00:01:42,240
I hope so! But I was so worried.

12
00:01:42,576 --> 00:01:44,864
I even got on the wrong bus.

13
00:01:45,184 --> 00:01:48,192
I was late to meet my friends. Oh,

14
00:01:48,576 --> 00:01:51,136
and I left my book on the bus too!

15
00:01:51,424 --> 00:01:54,416
Oh no. What a day!

